      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Arterial tissue was obtained from twelve severely obese patients during jejuno-ileal by-pass surgery. The arterial DNA content was inversely correlated with the sum of venous glucose values during an oral glucose tolerance test (rs = -0.72). This observation may have implications on the known relationship between decreased glucose tolerance and early manifestations of atherosclerosis."},
